                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'd rate it a 7.5/10 that ended up being more of an 8.5/10 for me. \r\nGreat characters and some interesting themes to explore. The storytelling was interesting, but a little jank at times in it's execution. While it definitely takes quite a bit of time before the MC becomes a compelling character, the other contestants POVs make up for that time. A solid VN that respected my time, and delivered a compelling story that feels uniquely compassionate when compared to its peers.",
